; claude: the platformer kit (see docs/claude_notes/plan_games.md,
; section 8 and "kits"): what platformers on tiles share, on top of the
; playground -- moving a box against a Tilemap one pixel at a time
; (Tile_move), climbing ladders (Ladder), and shaped ground felt by
; sensors (Slope). Used by TinyMario, TinyLodeRunner,
; TinyRick, TinySonic and TinyMarioWorld. A private
; library (only the games use it), installed with elm_playground for
; its API documentation.
(library
 (name kit_platformer)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_core elm_playground)
)
